meta {
  name: Category Orders (all open orders in my categories)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/master/orders/by-category
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  ~category_id: 1
  ~page: 1
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Locale: {{locale}}
}

docs {
  # Category Orders

  Every open (pending, unclaimed, search started) order in the master's
  categories — **regardless of distance**, newest first, paginated by 15.
  Orders the master declined or already responded to, and their own orders,
  are excluded.

  `category_id` (optional) narrows the list to one category; a category the
  master doesn't work in simply yields an empty list.

  `is_within_radius` tells whether `respond` will be accepted right now —
  respond still requires the master to be inside the order's search radius.
  Without a GPS ping `distance_km` is `null` and `is_within_radius` is `false`.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": 42,
        "client_name": "Aman Jumayev",
        "client_phone": "+99362111222",
        "category": "Сантехника",
        "city": "Ашхабад",
        "description": "Сломался кран на кухне",
        "address": "Ashgabat, Korogly 12",
        "latitude": 37.95,
        "longitude": 58.38,
        "distance_km": 12.4,
        "is_within_radius": false,
        "search_radius_km": 3,
        "search_started_at": "2026-08-15T10:00:00+05:00",
        "photos": [],
        "created_at": "2026-08-15T10:00:00+05:00"
      }
    ],
    "links": { "...": "..." },
    "meta": { "current_page": 1, "per_page": 15, "total": 1 }
  }
  ```
}
